---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Read a bounded inline-image chunk as JSON, without a host cache path

Usage: mxr attachments inline-bytes [OPTIONS] --source <SOURCE> <MESSAGE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>

Options:
      --source <SOURCE>
      --offset <OFFSET>  [default: 0]
      --length <LENGTH>  [default: 262144]
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
